# Nothing is required to run locally — the SQLite file path is hardcoded in
# prisma/schema.prisma so a fresh clone works with zero configuration.
#
# To move to Postgres later:
#   1. In prisma/schema.prisma set provider = "postgresql" and
#      url = env("DATABASE_URL")
#   2. Copy this file to .env and set the connection string below
#   3. npx prisma migrate dev
# No application code changes are needed.
#
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/thetide?schema=public"
